{"4048090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Chessboard Mystery:47 West Street,Highgate ", "steam_appid": 4048090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the quiet town of Highgate in 1956, a mysterious murder shatters the long-standing calm. As a hired private detective, you step into an investigation woven with lies, old grudges, and hidden interests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Chessboard Mystery: 47 West Street, Highgate</i> is a grounded detective adventure focused on logical reasoning. With an open investigation structure, you can freely explore multiple locations, collect evidence, examine items, trace the origins of clues, and cross-check information through suspect interrogations. Key findings are recorded on a dynamic deduction board, where you reconstruct the timeline, analyze contradictions, and uncover motives to reveal the full truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers branching paths, major choices, and multiple endings. Your decisions shape the direction of the investigation, affect character relationships, and ultimately determine whether you can identify the real culprit. By uncovering each suspect’s hidden past layer by layer, you will reveal the deeper truth behind what first appeared to be a simple murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic detective and deduction experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free exploration and evidence-gathering system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple suspects with cross-examinable interrogation paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deduction board, timeline reconstruction, and contradiction analysis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching narrative with multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complete 2–3 hour mystery case</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_pa